Package: bonsaiforest
Title: Bonsai Forest
Version: 1.0.0
Authors@R:
    person("Timothy", "Shen", , "tzshen@g.ucla.edu", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: An interpretable network-aware random-forest feature selection framework for
    high-dimensional and correlated data. Combines recursive feature elimination,
    WGCNA, and shadow-stability selection through TreeSHAP values. A Python environment with 	scikit-learn, shap, and numpy is
    required; configure it with bf_setup().
